        "derivation": "Column-by-column: each chained cell names the sibling whose pinned verdict covers it; revocation mechanisms echo the pinned revoke calls (erc-7715 wallet_revokeExecutionPermission, erc-7579 uninstall, erc-3009 cancelAuthorization) or the declared-not-revocable SPT bearer state; learn facts echo provider-visibility pins (Basis Theory proxy provider sees the card, x402 facilitator cannot modify amount or destination); the two columns no pinned source settles are marked unpinned_in_cited_sources and must raise LOCAL_FACT_UNPINNED."
